      ],
      "en": "Now the rest of the acts of Elah, and all that he did, aren’t they written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel?",
      "ko": "엘라의 남은 사적과 무릇 행한 일이 이스라엘 왕 역대지략에 기록되지 아니하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "645bb8bb49dc50d6cb9e63b7734face7d5aa880efd0430bb98560bdad2dbf11d",
      "translation_text_hash": "2b2d5c10cac2543ab4ff8356dc7927c52abfb330d6de5cb412cde1ebcae0894b",
