      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "The people who were encamped heard that Zimri had conspired, and had also killed the king. Therefore all Israel made Omri, the captain of the army, king over Israel that day in the camp.",
      "ko": "진중 백성들이 시므리가 모반하여 왕을 죽였다는 말을 들은지라 그 날에 이스라엘의 무리가 진에서 군대장관 오므리로 이스라엘 왕을 삼으매",
      "source_text_hash": "4b4035f3397de078805d6895087dce077d96896febe8de06b40a6427cb185464",
      "translation_text_hash": "f1de44be87f22b856ebda1f1a90e44d61883c8961b7b239550e2402b540dd9d5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
