      "en": "Omri went up from Gibbethon, and all Israel with him, and they besieged Tirzah.",
      "ko": "오므리가 이에 이스라엘 무리를 거느리고 깁브돈에서부터 올라와서 디르사를 에워 쌌더라",
      "source_text_hash": "fbda0d123b04c56c846f6a52bc6c796806916d0fd3ce1dbaa972513730c52067",
      "translation_text_hash": "a10c00a73140dea1439a564d2275262aa58106489ba1058c1f977f405c7392d6",
