      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "When Zimri saw that the city was taken, he went into the fortified part of the king’s house and burned the king’s house over him with fire, and died,",
      "ko": "시므리가 성이 함락됨을 보고 왕궁 위소에 들어가서 왕궁에 불을 놓고 그 가운데서 죽었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "2516bf23522a655e39cc9d88af15167a0215bd649eaf8bbe18b7c82f0467b502",
      "translation_text_hash": "b49c00be678c51fd02300fd79097193576ea1290396eeeb621dbef4b4f422c32",
