      "en": "for his sins which he sinned in doing that which was evil in the LORD’s sight, in walking in the way of Jeroboam, and in his sin which he did to make Israel to sin.",
      "ko": "이는 저가 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 범죄함을 인함이라 저가 여로보암의 길로 행하며 그가 이스라엘로 죄를 범하게 한 그 죄 중에 행하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e25228b2140a92cf452691576e632d0598667338367fcd2c7e83f2f9cff89de1",
      "translation_text_hash": "9283ecd8a3c9f11a37a9fef0b1088dead89a8c9ffebb4c79974290f0f69e1e44",
