      "en": "Omri did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight, and dealt wickedly above all who were before him.",
      "ko": "오므리가 여호와 보시기에 악을 행하되 그 전의 모든 사람보다 더욱 악하게 행하여",
      "source_text_hash": "8f286ecc7a07c731ef5cfca24b82a0f5817d136bf78b02f7e875113cc851d378",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1aae4cf26151b5a30bf9b0980949541222e46c50342da53afd2f7a5cd6ebde4",
