      "en": "So Omri slept with his fathers, and was buried in Samaria; and Ahab his son reigned in his place.",
      "ko": "오므리가 그 열조와 함께 자매 사마리아에 장사되고 그 아들 아합이 대신하여 왕이 되니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0b31c0ba93de509b3f80c1ac82b27a998bb2ee5ce0a88183378e0a4e213ba5cf",
      "translation_text_hash": "2bb96997f839d45e342520bce0cb9ae3310315773e9accc84e1c2735afbde4e5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
