      "en": "Ahab the son of Omri did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight above all that were before him.",
      "ko": "오므리의 아들 아합이 그 전의 모든 사람보다 여호와 보시기에 악을 더욱 행하여",
      "source_text_hash": "2671d64fbfdaa70d55b008fd1423f84a6a12abc7f324ba9dec9cbee13de3aad6",
      "translation_text_hash": "0b79e81d7f267ecb3872589e0f2ee190310b98145b2c9a28a281f80f32233df9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
